  "notes": "12-step sky scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: skyA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/sky.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/sky-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --sky-1: #f9feff;\n  --sky-2: #f1fafd;\n  --sky-3: #e1f6fd;\n  --sky-4: #d1f0fa;\n  --sky-5: #bee7f5;\n  --sky-6: #a9daed;\n  --sky-7: #8dcae3;\n  --sky-8: #60b3d7;\n  --sky-9: #7ce2fe;\n  --sky-10: #74daf8;\n  --sky-11: #00749e;\n  --sky-12: #1d3e56;\n}\n.dark {\n  --sky-1: #0d141f;\n  --sky-2: #111a27;\n  --sky-3: #112840;\n  --sky-4: #113555;\n  --sky-5: #154467;\n  --sky-6: #1b537b;\n  --sky-7: #1f6692;\n  --sky-8: #197cae;\n  --sky-9: #7ce2fe;\n  --sky-10: #a8eeff;\n  --sky-11: #75c7f0;\n  --sky-12: #c2f3ff;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix sky</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#f9feff\" title=\"--sky-1: #f9feff\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#f1fafd\" title=\"--sky-2: #f1fafd\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#e1f6fd\" title=\"--sky-3: #e1f6fd\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#d1f0fa\" title=\"--sky-4: #d1f0fa\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#bee7f5\" title=\"--sky-5: #bee7f5\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#a9daed\" title=\"--sky-6: #a9daed\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#8dcae3\" title=\"--sky-7: #8dcae3\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#60b3d7\" title=\"--sky-8: #60b3d7\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#7ce2fe\" title=\"--sky-9: #7ce2fe\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#74daf8\" title=\"--sky-10: #74daf8\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#00749e\" title=\"--sky-11: #00749e\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#1d3e56\" title=\"--sky-12: #1d3e56\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#0d141f\" title=\"--sky-1: #0d141f\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#111a27\" title=\"--sky-2: #111a27\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#112840\" title=\"--sky-3: #112840\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#113555\" title=\"--sky-4: #113555\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#154467\" title=\"--sky-5: #154467\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#1b537b\" title=\"--sky-6: #1b537b\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#1f6692\" title=\"--sky-7: #1f6692\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#197cae\" title=\"--sky-8: #197cae\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#7ce2fe\" title=\"--sky-9: #7ce2fe\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#a8eeff\" title=\"--sky-10: #a8eeff\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#75c7f0\" title=\"--sky-11: #75c7f0\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#c2f3ff\" title=\"--sky-12: #c2f3ff\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
